# Fast retriggers of the same keys on the 2-voice snare track (32nd notes of a long boom kick and a long bell,
# P2 255): every new hit steals a voice, which must fade within a block so the next one starts at once.
tempo 160
steps 16
tail 8.0
track snare
param p2 255 0
note 0 G3 1 127
note 0.5 G3 1 127
note 1 G3 1 127
note 1.5 G3 1 127
note 2 G3 1 127
note 2.5 G3 1 127
note 3 G3 1 127
note 3.5 G3 1 127
note 8 Db5 1 127
note 8.5 Db5 1 100
note 9 Db5 1 80
note 9.5 Db5 1 127
note 10 Db5 1 60
note 10.5 Db5 1 127
note 11 Db5 1 127
note 11.5 Db5 1 127
expect sound 0 16
expect idle 80
expect peak_below 0
